\n\n![micasa-dev](https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/269165224?s=60&v=4)\n\n**[micasa](/micasa-dev/micasa)**\n\nPublic\n\n- [Notifications](/login?return_to=%2Fmicasa-dev%2Fmicasa)\n\n- [Fork (56)](/login?return_to=%2Fmicasa-dev%2Fmicasa)\n\n- [Star (1\\.3k)](/login?return_to=%2Fmicasa-dev%2Fmicasa)\n\n## About\n\nA modal TUI for tracking home projects, maintenance schedules, appliances, and vendor quotes.\n\n[micasa.dev](https://micasa.dev)\n\n### Resources\n\n[Readme](#readme-ov-file)\n\nApache-2.0, MIT licenses found\n\n### Code of conduct\n\n[Code of conduct](/micasa-dev/micasa#coc-ov-file)\n\n### Contributing\n\n[Contributing](#contributing-ov-file)\n\n### Security policy\n\n[Security policy](#security-ov-file)\n\n[Activity](/micasa-dev/micasa/activity)\n\n[Custom properties](/micasa-dev/micasa/custom-properties)\n\n### Stars\n\n**1\\.3k** stars\n\n### Watchers\n\n**3** watching\n\n### Forks\n\n[**56** forks](/micasa-dev/micasa/forks)\n\n[Report repository](/contact/report-content?content_url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fmicasa-dev%2Fmicasa&report=micasa-dev+%28user%29)\n\nmain\n\n[Branches](/micasa-dev/micasa/branches)[Tags](/micasa-dev/micasa/tags)\n\n[](/micasa-dev/micasa/branches)[](/micasa-dev/micasa/tags)\n\nGo to file\n\nCode\n\n## Latest commit\n\n \n\n## History\n\n[1,290 Commits](/micasa-dev/micasa/commits/main/)\n\n[](/micasa-dev/micasa/commits/main/)\n\n## Folders and files\n\nName | Name | Last commit message | Last commit date\n\n[.claude](/micasa-dev/micasa/tree/main/.claude \".claude\") | [.claude](/micasa-dev/micasa/tree/main/.claude \".claude\") |  |\n\n[.github](/micasa-dev/micasa/tree/main/.github \".github\") | [.github](/micasa-dev/micasa/tree/main/.github \".github\") |  |\n\n[ci/release](/micasa-dev/micasa/tree/main/ci/release \"This path skips through empty directories\") | [ci/release](/micasa-dev/micasa/tree/main/ci/release \"This path skips through empty directories\") |  |\n\n[cmd](/micasa-dev/micasa/tree/main/cmd \"cmd\") | [cmd