SION](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/VERSION \"VERSION\") |  |\n\n[biome.json](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/biome.json \"biome.json\") | [biome.json](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/biome.json \"biome.json\") |  |\n\n[codecov.yml](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/codecov.yml \"codecov.yml\") | [codecov.yml](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/codecov.yml \"codecov.yml\") |  |\n\n[flake.lock](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/flake.lock \"flake.lock\") | [flake.lock](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/flake.lock \"flake.lock\") |  |\n\n[flake.nix](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/flake.nix \"flake.nix\") | [flake.nix](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/flake.nix \"flake.nix\") |  |\n\n[go.mod](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/go.mod \"go.mod\") | [go.mod](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/go.mod \"go.mod\") |  |\n\n[go.sum](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/go.sum \"go.sum\") | [go.sum](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/go.sum \"go.sum\") |  |\n\n[osv-scanner.toml](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/osv-scanner.toml \"osv-scanner.toml\") | [osv-scanner.toml](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/osv-scanner.toml \"osv-scanner.toml\") |  |\n\n[renovate.json](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/renovate.json \"renovate.json\") | [renovate.json](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/renovate.json \"renovate.json\") |  |\n\nView all files\n\n## Repository files navigation\n\n- [README](#)\n\n- [Code of conduct](#)\n\n- [Contributing](#)\n\n- [Apache-2.0 license](#)\n\n- [MIT license](#)\n\n- [Security](#)\n\nMore items\n\n[![micasa](/micasa-dev/micasa/raw/main/images/house.svg)](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/images/house.svg)\n\n  \n  \n\n[![CI](https://github.com/micasa-dev/micasa/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/micasa-dev/micasa/actions/workflows/ci.yml) [![Release](https://camo.githubusercontent.com/fe229db5a233f7b2613ad3986dfc5e5d423d512acfecd128c7c2400307f46066/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f762f72656c656173652f6d69636173612d6465762f6d6963617361)](https://github.com/micasa-dev/micasa/releases/latest) [![Go](https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9966538a1c2d308fb93e8d3bcecd6698f74a123a2a3d86f501e6cf6348c77c9e/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f676f2d6d6f642f676f2d76657273696f6e2f6d69636173612d6465762f6d6963617361)](https://go.dev) [![Docs](https://camo.githubusercontent.com/ab2604c12ccee7e54545de9ff6b506c58b1f80ef10cc431a3b86030d35b8c0df/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f646f63732d6d69636173612e6465762d626c7565)](https://micasa.dev/docs)\n\n# `micasa`\n\n[](#micasa)\n\nHome maintenance, from the terminal.\n\n[![micasa demo](/micasa-dev/micasa/raw/main/images/demo.webp)](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/images/demo.webp)\n\n## Features\n\n[](#features)\n\n- **When did I last change the furnace filter?** Schedules, due dates, full history. Set it and forget it.\n\n- **What if we finally did the backyard?** Projects from napkin sketch to completion, or graceful abandonment.\n\n- **How much would it cost to…** Quotes side by side, vendor history, and the math to actually decide.\n\n- **Who did we use last time?** Every contractor, every quote, every job. All searchable.\n\n- **How much have I spent on plumbing this year?** Ask a local LLM. Or don't. Offline until you say otherwise.\n\n## Keyboard driven\n\n[](#keyboard-driven)\n\nVim-style modal keys: `nav` mode to browse, `edit` mode to change things. Sort by any column, jump to columns with fuzzy search, hide what you don't need, and drill into related records.\n\nSee the full [keybinding reference](https://micasa.dev/docs/reference/keybindings/).\n\n## Install\n\n[](#install)\n\n```\ngo install github.com/micasa-dev/micasa/cmd/micasa@latest\n```\n\nOr grab a [binary](https://github.com/micasa-dev/micasa/releases/latest) for Linux, macOS, or Windows.\n\nThen:\n\n```\nmicasa demo         # sample data\nmicasa              # your house\n```\n\n## Documentation\n\n[](#documentation)\n\nFull docs at [micasa.dev/docs](https://micasa.dev/docs/).\n\n## Development\n\n[](#development)\n\n[Pure Go](https://go.dev), zero CGO. Built on [Charmbracelet](https://github.com/charmbracelet) \\+ [GORM](https://gorm.io) \\+ [SQLite](https://sqlite.org). TUI design inspired by [VisiData](https://www.visidata.org/). Developed with AI coding agents ([Claude](https://claude.ai), [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)).\n\nPRs welcome, including AI-assisted ones, as long as you've reviewed and curated the code. See the [contributing guide](https://micasa.dev/docs/development/contributing/).\n\n```\nnix develop                      # enter dev shell\ngo test -shuffle=on ./...        # run tests\n```\n\n## License\n\n[](#license)\n\nApache-2.0. See [LICENSE](/micasa-dev/micasa/blob/main/LICENSE).\n\n## About\n\nA modal TUI for tracking home projects, maintenance schedules, appliances, and vendor quotes.\n\n[micasa.dev](https://micasa.dev)\n\n### Resources\n\n[Readme](#readme-ov-file)\n\nApache-2.0, MIT licenses found\n\n### Code of conduct\n\n[Code of conduct](/micasa-dev/micasa#coc-ov-file)\n\n### Contributing\n\n[Contributing](#contributing-ov-file)\n\n### Security policy\n\n[Security policy](#security-ov-file)\n\n[Activity](/micasa-dev/micasa/activity)\n\n[Custom properties](/micasa-dev/micasa/custom-properties)\n\n### Stars\n\n**1\\.3k** stars\n\n### Watchers\n\n**3** watching\n\n### Forks\n\n[**56** forks](/micasa-dev/micasa/forks)\n\n[Report repository](/contact/report-content?content_url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fmicasa-dev%2Fmicasa&report=micasa-dev+%28user%29)\n\n## Releases\n\n## Packages\n\n## Contributors\n\n## Languages\n\n## Footer\n\n[](https://github.com) © 2026 GitHub, Inc.\n\n### Footer navigation\n\n- [Terms](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/github-terms/github-terms-of-service)\n\n- [Privacy](https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement)\n\n- [Security](https://github.com/security)\n\n- [Status](https://www.githubstatus.com/)\n\n- [Community](https://github.community/)\n\n- [Docs](https://docs.github.com